hecks across all backend and frontend files.\n\n5. **Active Context**\n   - Daemon Task `f7fe8eca-ba38-4dcb-97a7-a40aeb890237/task-762` is running `server.py` on port 3000 using `/Users/pranit405/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/audit-it/venv/bin/python3`.\n   - `privacyMasker.js` was inspected right before this turn ended and needs the column swap check added to match `itemCleaner.js`.\n\n6. **Next Steps**\n   1. **Update `utils/privacyMasker.js`**:\n      - In `sanitizeInvoiceData`, add the column swap check (`if (billed > 0 && qty === billed && (rate === 1 || rate === 2)) { qty = 1.0; rate = billed; }`) and unit trimming on description.\n   2. **Restart Backend Server**:\n      - Kill task `f7fe8eca-ba38-4dcb-97a7-a40aeb890237/task-762` and restart `server.py 3000` via venv python as daemon so latest `utils/clean_items.py` changes are loaded.\n   3. **Verification**:\n      - Run unit test in Python asserting that a test item with `quantity=535, unit_rate=2, total_amount=535` is automatically swapped to `quantity=1.0, unit_rate=535.0, total_amount=535.0`.\n      - Run JS syntax validation check across all `.js` files.\n      - Test `POST /api/analyze-bill` with `TestClient` in venv python.\n   4. **Respond to User**:\n      - Confirm table column alignment prompt instructions and column swap fallback are live and verified.\n\n7. **Commitments & Constraints**\n   - Code calculates, AI extracts: do not trust LLM to perform arithmetic.\n   - Zero dummy ₹1.00 / fake items: only use actual data returned by Gemini.\n   - Do not re-introduce `is_valid_bill` or gatekeeper rejection checks.\n   - Format clickable links using `file://` scheme.\n</summary>\n\n# Running Background Tasks\nThe following background tasks were running at the time this checkpoint was created.\nUse the manage_task tool to interact with them (e.g. to kill them or check their status).\n\n{\n  \"taskId\":  \"f7fe8eca-ba38-4dcb-97a7-a40aeb890237/task-762\",\n  \"toolName\":  \"run_command\",\n  \"toolSumma